From: guf296 <guf296@126.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 14:15:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: novatek-nt36523: add Lenovo TB321FU

Add the Kirby CSOT command sequence, 120/60 Hz modes, dual-link DSC
configuration, bias-rail sequencing and compatible aliases used by
the Lenovo Legion Y700 Gen 3 / TB321FU.

This is a minimal reconstruction of the panel portion of GUF296's
TB321FU aggregation. It retains the v7.2 devm-managed panel, secondary
DSI-device and DSI-attach lifecycle, and makes the extra rails, reset
timing and DSC steps specific to the Kirby descriptor.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
index 226d91daf..ebc36df51 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
